msgstr[0] "%1$d site for dis network dey set to erase im Babilim identity wen dem delete di plugin. Di paid license wey dey attach to dat site no go fit restore automatically after dat; you go need contact Babilim support for %2$s. To keep di identity, press Cancel, untick \"Delete all Babilim data wen you uninstall am\" for dat site Babilim settings, then deactivate again. Deactivate anyway?"
msgstr[1] "%1$d sites for dis network dey set to erase dia Babilim identity wen dem delete di plugin. Di paid license wey dey attach to those sites no go fit restore automatically after dat; you go need contact Babilim support for %2$s. To keep di identities, press Cancel, untick \"Delete all Babilim data wen you uninstall am\" for each site Babilim settings, then deactivate again. Deactivate anyway?"

